    "title": "Dallas Police Hunt 3 Men After Gunfire Nearly Hits 1-Year-Old at Store - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sofia Vasquez ,\n9 hours ago Little World Convenience Store — Approximate Site of October 11 Shooting. Dallas police are asking the public to help identify three men caught on surveillance video in a shootout at a South Dallas convenience store that reportedly came within inches of striking a 1-year-old child. The gunfire broke out just after 1 a.m. on October 11 at Little World convenience store in the 4,600 block of Malcolm X Boulevard. Read full article\n4",
